<translation id="1848444672771235816">I-Chrome - Izenzo ezisheshayo</translation>
<translation id="6834084925134176532">Ukuze uqhubeke nokusebenzisa le wijethi, ngaphansi kwesikrini, thepha okuthi Hlela, bese uthepha okuthi +. Iya ku-Chrome bese ukhetha Izenzo Ezisheshayo.</translation>
